        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "gamma from 0.25x to 4x shortens analytical wavelength 62 to 15.5 µm and noise-selected wavelength 62 to 13.3 µm, both monotone. The Famennian operating point is reported twice: seeded 31.0 µm and unseeded 26.57 µm, so the seed dependence is measured rather than hidden." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
